Authorised_Budgets_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the budget does not exist
│   └── it should return false
├── when who is the budget's Safe
│   └── it should return true
├── when who wears the budget's hat in good standing
│   └── it should return true
├── when who wears the hat of a budget above it in good standing
│   └── it should return true
├── when who wears the hat but is not in good standing
│   └── it should return false
├── when the hat is inactive or its wearer is ineligible
│   └── it should return false
├── when who wears only the hat of a budget below it
│   └── it should return false
├── when who wears only the hat of a sibling budget
│   └── it should return false
├── when who wears only a Director hat
│   └── it should return false
└── when who wears no hat on the budget's path
    └── it should return false
